          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "DeepMind's David Silver raises $1.1B to build AI that learns without any human-generated data",
            "articleSection": "Discovery & Research",
            "abstract": "Ineffable Intelligence, founded by former DeepMind researcher David Silver — the architect of AlphaGo — has raised $1.1 billion in funding at a valuation of $5.1 billion just months after its founding. The lab is pursuing a fundamentally different approach to AI, building systems that learn entirely without human-generated training data. If successful, this would remove one of the core bottlenecks in modern AI development: the requirement for vast quantities of human-labelled or human-produced content.",
            "url": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/04/27/deepminds-david-silver-just-raised-1-1b-to-build-an-ai-that-learns-without-human-data/",
